     *
     * To convert a backup to a VPS snapshot, send a PATCH request with the `action` attribute set to `convert`.
     *
     * The response contains a `Content-Location` header with the URL of the action that was started, see [Actions](https://api.transip.nl/rest/docs.html#actions) for more information.
     *
     * Body ($data):
     * - description (string, optional): e.g. `BeforeItsAllBroken`
     *
     * Sends "action": "convert" for you.
     *
     * PATCH /v6/vps/{vpsIdentifier}/backups/{backupId}
     *
     * @link https://api.transip.nl/rest/docs.html#vps-vps-backups-patch-1
     *
